    "length_matching": "No arbitrary global match groups for UART/I2C/SPI/ADC/oscillator; USB policy to follow verified AN4879 and stackup.",
    "current_budget": "150mA normal total V3V3 / Ta0-40C; input fuse500mA is not unrestricted current qualification",
